  Slug: skin-hard-as-horn
  DisplayName: Skin Hard as Horn
  IconPath: icons/creatures/magical/construct-golem-stone-blue.webp
  Description: "Usage imbued in the skin Tempered in your spirit, your very skin
    is as a suit of armor, though a single location on your body remains unprotected,
    a curse and a challenge within your legend. During your daily preparations, you
    can strike your skin lightly with an object that deals bludgeoning, slashing
    or piecing damage to habituate your skin against this type of injury, attuning
    the ikon to that damage type. Immanence When your skin houses your divine spark,
    you gain resistance to the attuned damage type equal to half your level. This
    resistance doesn't apply against critical hits, which successfully find your
    unprotected spot. Transcendence\u2014 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Crash
    Against Me] 1 (transcendence) @Embed[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Cu7P7NB3XH67mi1N
    inline]"
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder War of Immortals
